Package: jwm-tools
Version: @VERSION@-1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Luciano Biancardine <lucianobiancardine@gmail.com>
Depends: python3:any (>= 3.9), python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, python3-cairo, python3-tk, python3-pulsectl, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-pango-1.0, libfontconfig1, jwm (>= 2.4)
Recommends: fonts-dejavu-core
Conflicts: jwm-style-editor
Replaces: jwm-style-editor
Homepage: https://github.com/lucianobianc/JWM-Tools
Description: audio, menu, resource monitor and style tools for JWM
 jwm_audio controls PulseAudio-compatible devices and application volumes.
 jwm_menu generates a JWM menu from installed desktop entries.
 jwm_ram displays Linux resource usage in the tray.
 jwm_style edits JWM appearance and saves personal styles.
